Scholar: {
	DisplayName: Scholar
	BestiaryEntry1: A traveler from a faraway land. They washed up on the shores of your island with only their bag full of notebooks and stationary.
	BestiaryEntry2: They seek to learn all about this island and its inhabitants, and is happy to recieve your help in that goal.

	TownNPCMood: {
		Content: I feel comforable here.
		NoHome: I need somewhere to unpack my stuff.
		FarFromHome: I am far from my books. My research cannot continue.
		LoveSpace: So much space to do my work, I like it.
		DislikeCrowded: It's a little too crowded for me.
		HateCrowded: It's very crowded. Please move me.
